  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;This is electrophilic substitution reaction which is determine by electronic effect of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>OH</mi><mo>\\</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>\\</mo><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>.<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/14570784-5d58-4f77-9bbc-ba7fa1461a6e-image.png\" style=\"width: 531px; height: 201px;\" /></p><p>Electrophilic attacks in influence of activating group&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>OH</mi></math>&nbsp;so it is attached at para position with respect to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>OH</mi></math>&nbsp;group.</p>",
